1 Installation
**************

Dicom.el is available from GNU ELPA
(https://elpa.gnu.org/packages/dicom.html).  You can install it directly
via ‘M-x package-install RET dicom RET’.  After installation, you can
open ‘DICOMDIR’ and DICOM image files.

   Emacs must be compiled with support for PNG, SVG and XML.  The
package relies on external programs from the DCMTK
(https://dcmtk.org/en/dcmtk/) DICOM toolkit, which are all widely
available on GNU/Linux distributions.

   • ‘dcm2xml’ and ‘dcmj2pnm’ from the DCMTK
     (https://dcmtk.org/en/dcmtk/) DICOM toolkit
   • ‘ffmpeg’ for video conversion (optional)
   • ‘mpv’ for video playing (optional)


